10
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:43,873
Imagine a teacher planning future classes and support services. If an

11
00:00:43,873 --> 00:00:48,353
existing revenue stream ends, a budget planner must consider cuts,

12
00:00:48,353 --> 00:00:53,533
replacement taxes, or other funding. Keeping that revenue can avoid that

13
