14
00:00:58,673 --> 00:01:01,273
School budgets depend on the wider state budget.

15
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:06,040
The analyst estimates five to fifteen billion dollars of annual revenue

16
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:11,040
maintained after the scheduled expiration. The wide range reflects the

17
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:15,720
volatile incomes and investment gains of high earners. It is not a

18
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:20,480
guaranteed fifteen billion every year. Roughly forty percent would support

19
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:25,100
schools and community colleges. The remainder supports other state programs

20
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:29,900
and reserves. Those shares describe the analyst’s estimate, rather than a

21
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:34,620
