25
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:51,040
A voter might prefer protecting existing revenue for education and other

26
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:56,660
services, with the additional tax concentrated on high earners. Making the

27
00:01:56,660 --> 00:02:01,140
